OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASeoul summons Ukraine envoy over North
OL,4,AKorean prisoner-of-war row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two North Koreans, who were among
OL,7,Fthousands of soldiers supporting Russia
OL,8,Fin the Ukraine war, had earlier told
OL,9,Flocal media they wanted to be sent to
OL,10,FSouth Korea.
OL,12,FPresident Lee Jae Myung called the
OL,13,Fdisclosure "greatly disappointing" and
OL,14,Fsaid the transfer was a "highly
OL,15,Fsensitive issue" impacting national
OL,16,Fsecurity.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
